.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The \fBio\fR module provides direct kernel i/o, typed file descriptors (fd), and streaming traits for Zoril programs.\&
All operations interface directly with kernel facilities or safe region\-allocated
memory without relying on the C runtime library.\&
.PP
